{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_25", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": -106, "width": 1396, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1048386556, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 351564608, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_26", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -90, "width": 1352, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1289560150, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2126508551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - WORKFLOW REVIEW (20 MIN)", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - WORKFLOW REVIEW (20 MIN)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_27", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -54, "width": 1352, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1475216846, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1927728187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Your intake/lead-routing workflow first, then the 8 follow-ups: speed-to-lead, consult reminders, proposal chase, nurture, reactivation, reviews and referrals. Anything that overlaps an\nolder workflow goes on your list.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your intake/lead-routing workflow first, then the 8 follow-ups: speed-to-lead, consult reminders, proposal chase, nurture, reactivation, reviews and referrals. Anything that overlaps an\nolder workflow goes on your list.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_28", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1492, "y": -106, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1236683273, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314395343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_29", "type": "text", "x": 1514, "y": -90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - CLAUDE STRATEGY (15 MIN)", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - CLAUDE STRATEGY (15 MIN)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_30", "type": "text", "x": 1514, "y": -54, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Claude already reads and writes your contacts, tags and opportunities through the connector. Timed messages stay in GHL, judgment calls go\nto Claude, and tags pass the work between them.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Claude already reads and writes your contacts, tags and opportunities through the connector. Timed messages stay in GHL, judgment calls go\nto Claude, and tags pass the work between them.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_31", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2738, "y": -90, "width": 1396, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_32", "type": "text", "x": 2760, "y": -74, "width": 1352, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - TESTING AND REPORTING (15 MIN)", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - TESTING AND REPORTING (15 MIN)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_33", "type": "text", "x": 2760, "y": -38, "width": 1352, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Your two silent failures: empty merge fields and leads that never enter a workflow. GHL catches the first before the send, and Claude finds the second by the missing tag.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your two silent failures: empty merge fields and leads that never enter a workflow. GHL catches the first before the send, and Claude finds the second by the missing tag.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_34", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4334, "y": -122, "width": 352, "height": 250, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_35", "type": "text", "x": 4356, "y": -106, "width": 308, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - NEXT STEPS (10 MIN)", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - NEXT STEPS (10 MIN)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_36", "type": "text", "x": 4356, "y": -71, "width": 308, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Your prioritized list of improvements, in\nwriting after the call. The fixes that\nprotect the most leads come first.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your prioritized list of improvements, in\nwriting after the call. The fixes that\nprotect the most leads come first.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_37"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - We meet for 60 minutes on\nZoom or Google Meet, with your\nGHL on screen", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_1", "originalText": "1 - We meet for 60 minutes on\nZoom or Google Meet, with your\nGHL on screen", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 280, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 311111476, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 404285458, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_4"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_37"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_38"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_4", "type": "text", "x": 292.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1570621945, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 249103478, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - We follow one new lead\nthrough your intake and\nlead-routing workflow", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_3", "originalText": "2 - We follow one new lead\nthrough your intake and\nlead-routing workflow", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 628, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 922121677, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 161042649, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_6"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_38"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_39"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_6", "type": "text", "x": 64